---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title={"PiPi Word Voyage Privacy Policy - PiFl Labs"}
  description={"PiFl Labs Co., Ltd. PiPi Word Voyage app privacy policy"}
  canonical="https://pifl-labs.com/en/apps/pipi-word-voyage/privacy/"
  alternates={[{"hreflang":"en","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/en/apps/pipi-word-voyage/privacy/"},{"hreflang":"ko","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/ko/apps/pipi-word-voyage/privacy/"},{"hreflang":"ja","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/ja/apps/pipi-word-voyage/privacy/"},{"hreflang":"x-default","href":"https://pifl-labs.com/ko/apps/pipi-word-voyage/privacy/"}]}
  extraCss={["/styles.css"]}
>
<!-- Legal Header -->
    <section class="legal-hero">
        <div class="container">
            <a href="/" class="legal-back"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to Home</a>
            <h1><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> <span class="text-gradient">PiPi Word Voyage Privacy Policy</span></h1>
            <p class="legal-date">Effective Date: July 9, 2026</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Legal Content -->
    <main class="legal-page">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="legal-card">
                <p>PiFl Labs Co., Ltd. ("Company", "we", "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use the mobile application <strong>PiPi Word Voyage</strong> ("App"). For matters not covered here, our <a href="/en/privacy">general Privacy Policy</a> applies.</p>

                <h2>Summary</h2>
                <p><strong>PiPi Word Voyage does not collect any personal data.</strong> The App has no accounts or login, no server or backend, and makes no network calls during gameplay. Your game progress (islands charted, hints used, preferences) is stored only on your device and is never transmitted externally.</p>

                <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
                <p>We do not collect any personal data through the App, and there is no account registration. The only data the App handles is:</p>
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Category</th>
                            <th>Items</th>
                            <th>How it is handled</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Game progress</td>
                            <td>Islands/seas progress, hint usage, preferences</td>
                            <td>Stored locally on device (shared_preferences); never transmitted</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Email inquiries (optional)</td>
                            <td>Email address, message content</td>
                            <td>Only if you contact us by email yourself</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <p>Note: advertising and analytics SDKs are present in the code but are <strong>disabled</strong> in this version, so no ads are shown and no advertising identifiers or usage data are collected. If we enable ads or analytics in the future, we will update this policy and disclose it within the app.</p>

                <h2>2. Data Retention</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Local game data</strong>: kept on your device until you delete the App or clear its data.</li>
                    <li><strong>Email inquiries</strong>: retained for <strong>3 years</strong> after the inquiry is resolved.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>3. Sharing and Processors</h2>
                <p>Because we collect no personal data through the App, we do not share data with third parties or use external processors. Information collected by the app stores (Apple App Store, Google Play) during distribution is governed by their respective privacy policies.</p>

                <h2>4. Permissions</h2>
                <p>The App requires no special system permissions for gameplay. If ad functionality is enabled in the future, internet access and iOS App Tracking Transparency prompts may be added, and you will be able to decline them.</p>

                <h2>5. Children's Privacy</h2>
                <p>The App is not directed to children under 13 and collects no personal data. For any questions, contact us at <a href="#" data-email-user="privacy" data-email-domain="pifl-labs.com"><span class="email-text"></span></a>.</p>

                <h2>6. Security</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>No-collection design: no personal data is collected or stored on servers.</li>
                    <li>Game data is stored only on the user's device.</li>
                    <li>Only standard encryption (HTTPS) is used; no non-standard encryption is included.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
                <p>You may contact us at any time regarding this policy at <a href="#" data-email-user="privacy" data-email-domain="pifl-labs.com"><span class="email-text"></span></a>.</p>

                <h3>GDPR (European Economic Area)</h3>
                <p>If you are located in the EEA, you have rights under the GDPR including access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability, and objection. As the App collects no personal data, there is no processing to object to; for any questions contact <a href="#" data-email-user="privacy" data-email-domain="pifl-labs.com"><span class="email-text"></span></a>.</p>

                <h2>8. Contact</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Company: PiFl Labs Co., Ltd.</li>
                    <li>Email: <a href="#" data-email-user="privacy" data-email-domain="pifl-labs.com"><span class="email-text"></span></a></li>
                </ul>

                <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
                <p>This Privacy Policy is effective as of July 9, 2026. Any changes will be posted on this page.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
</BaseLayout>
